                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a2e22c0-7160-4366-9096-eaf08b06bfc8",
                                "sense_id": "cbf92baf-c9bd-3308-9eca-ae96b70f79b1",
                                "text": "Он первым словом сообщил старухе, что у них в плашку попала лисица. Он совсем забыл, что старуха не пила вместе с ним водки, и был сильно удивлён, когда, невзирая на радостное известие, она немедленно нанесла ему ногою жестокий удар пониже спины.",
                                "translation": "His first words were to tell his wife that a fox had been caught in one of his traps, and as he had forgotten entirely that the old woman had not shared his vodka, he was violently surprised when she gave him a cruel kick, without paying any attention to his good news.",
                                "english": "His first words were to tell his wife that a fox had been caught in one of his traps, and as he had forgotten entirely that the old woman had not shared his vodka, he was violently surprised when she gave him a cruel kick, without paying any attention to his good news."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
